# Place Postman screenshots here.
#
# The README references these file names (PNG) — add them and they render automatically:
#   register.png      → POST /api/v1/auth/register
#   login.png         → POST /api/v1/auth/login
#   create-alert.png  → POST /api/v1/alerts
#   get-alerts.png    → GET  /api/v1/alerts
#   delete-alert.png  → DELETE /api/v1/alerts/:id
#   latest-rate.png   → GET  /api/v1/rates/latest/:currencyPair
#   health.png        → GET  /api/v1/health
